>Wait a moment.. what exactly does that "1+" part of the formula mean?
>So, if I have 1000 zorkmids, I first drop 500 zorkmids and have 2 units less
>weight, then I drop another 500 zorkmids and have 2 more units less weight.
>Altogether, I have dropped 1000 zorkmids and have 4 units less weight.
