Yes. :-)
Order of operations says you do the Num_Zorkmids/500 part first, then add 1.
So, if you started with 1000 z's, you'd have 1+(1000/2) or weight of 3.
Dropping 500 of them will give you weight 2, but dropping the last 500 will
reduce that portion of your weight to 0.

